cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the associated article."
type: software
title: "Field-scale PINNs for groundwater: Bayesian optimisation and FiLM modulation"
abstract: >-
  Physics-informed neural networks (PINNs) for field-scale groundwater modelling in a
  data-scarce alluvial aquifer (Varuna River basin, India). The code jointly predicts
  hydraulic head and estimates anisotropic hydraulic conductivity and storage, and
  compares a baseline PINN, a PINN with Bayesian (Optuna) hyperparameter optimisation,
  and a FiLM-conditioned PINN under random and temporal validation splits.
